tolls, and controls</article-title><source>Cell</source><year>1994</year><volume>78</volume><fpage>915</fpage><lpage>918</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7522969</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-wrap><fig id="f1-0010212" position="float"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>iNOS labeling index in reduced epithelium and stratified squamous epithelium of dental follicles. Values were expressed as means &#x000b1; S.D. *: P&#x0003c;.05 when compared to mild inflammation.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="a4-fig1"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>